    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[Engage in the Devil's turn-base puzzle]<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726100/extras/121359615bd346dfa1d5e2f24cb4499e.poster.avif?t=1750927637\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726100/extras/121359615bd346dfa1d5e2f24cb4499e.webm?t=1750927637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726100/extras/121359615bd346dfa1d5e2f24cb4499e.mp4?t=1750927637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ensure your victims are as desperate as possible by giving them: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jealousy</strong>, <strong>Sadness</strong>, <strong>Delicious food</strong>, <strong>Paranoia</strong>, divine judgment, and <strong>Bad luck</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[Put your victims through different stages]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>-&quot;Break them, make them insane if you must but bring me their souls&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726100/extras/377c5fa29079a7395aec7075d1bc8735.poster.avif?t=1750927637\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726100/extras/377c5fa29079a7395aec7075d1bc8735.webm?t=1750927637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726100/extras/377c5fa29079a7395aec7075d1bc8735.mp4?t=1750927637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[What Offer would bring to the table?]</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>- \u201dPromise them the whole world, and make one hell of a Deal!\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726100/extras/fb6c69f3cd9b71332b8f425d102361f5.poster.avif?t=1750927637\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726100/extras/fb6c69f3cd9b71332b8f425d102361f5.webm?t=1750927637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726100/extras/fb6c69f3cd9b71332b8f425d102361f5.mp4?t=1750927637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more desperate the victims are the less you have to offer, and the more you could ask for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[Have you steel your resolve?]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>-&quot; If not, just use your victim's resolve against them&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726100/extras/01fe5cb68e21cc359f856c82bf0315de.poster.avif?t=1750927637\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726100/extras/01fe5cb68e21cc359f856c82bf0315de.webm?t=1750927637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726100/extras/01fe5cb68e21cc359f856c82bf0315de.mp4?t=1750927637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Losing a bet with the Grim Reaper\u00a0lead you to rot in hell forever. The End.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Well, it seems not even forever isn\u2019t as long as it used to be... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Since you got out with a little help, but of course, it wasn't for free.</p>",
