ke one hell of a Deal!\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726100/extras/fb6c69f3cd9b71332b8f425d102361f5.poster.avif?t=1750927637\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726100/extras/fb6c69f3cd9b71332b8f425d102361f5.webm?t=1750927637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726100/extras/fb6c69f3cd9b71332b8f425d102361f5.mp4?t=1750927637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more desperate the victims are the less you have to offer, and the more you could ask for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[Have you steel your resolve?]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>-&quot; If not, just use your victim's resolve against them&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726100/extras/01fe5cb68e21cc359f856c82bf0315de.poster.avif?t=1750927637\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726100/extras/01fe5cb68e21cc359f856c82bf0315de.webm?t=1750927637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726100/extras/01fe5cb68e21cc359f856c82bf0315de.mp4?t=1750927637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Losing a bet with the Grim Reaper\u00a0lead you to rot in hell forever. The End.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Well, it seems not even forever isn\u2019t as long as it used to be... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Since you got out with a little help, but of course, it wasn't for free.</p>",
